<!--
  Canonical pages only.

  `/faq`, `/cookies`, `/seller-agreement` and `/prohibited-items` are deliberately
  absent. Each renders another page's row (/faq is the About content, /cookies is
  Privacy, /seller-agreement and /prohibited-items are Terms) and each declares
  that page's URL as its canonical, so see LEGAL_PAGES in src/lib/pageSeo.ts.
  Submitting a URL while telling Google its canonical is a different URL is a
  contradictory signal: the alias spends crawl budget and Search Console reports
  "Duplicate, submitted URL not selected as canonical". Those four routes stay
  linked, prerendered and reachable, they are just not submitted.

  Department (/categories/<slug>) and collection (/collections/<slug>) URLs come
  from database rows, so this static file cannot list them; the build writes
  them to sitemap-categories.xml (scripts/prerenderPublicPages.ts), and each
  prerendered page declares its own canonical. The bare /categories URL is a
  permanent redirect to /marketplace and is intentionally not submitted.

  Public seller storefronts are also data-backed and are served from
  sitemap-sellers.xml by the live API route. Only approved sellers with at
  least one active approved product are included; seller dashboard routes
  remain blocked by robots.txt.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/</loc><changefreq>daily</changefreq><priority>1.0</priority></url>
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/marketplace</loc><changefreq>daily</changefreq><priority>0.9</priority></url>
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/about</loc><changefreq>monthly</changefreq><priority>0.5</priority></url>
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/contact</loc><changefreq>monthly</changefreq><priority>0.5</priority></url>
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/terms</loc><changefreq>yearly</changefreq><priority>0.3</priority></url>
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/privacy</loc><changefreq>yearly</changefreq><priority>0.3</priority></url>
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/shipping</loc><changefreq>yearly</changefreq><priority>0.3</priority></url>
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/payment</loc><changefreq>yearly</changefreq><priority>0.3</priority></url>
  <url><loc>https://www.tradibu.com/refund-policy</loc><changefreq>yearly</changefreq><priority>0.3</priority></url>
</urlset>
